    <p class="page-disclaimer" style="padding:14px 0 0;">
      All BOM costs are conceptual estimates for a v1 prototype build (April 2026). Actual costs will vary based on volume, supplier negotiations, and final component selection. Medical-grade EMG electrodes may require additional regulatory review. This device is intended as a general wellness product and has not been submitted for FDA clearance.
    </p>
